{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/296208-a-vampire-mini-series","id":296208,"title":"a vampire mini series","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-29T14:48:37-07:00","id":296208,"title":"a vampire mini series","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> Although it's extremely unlikely that anyone remembers, I used to lurk (and occasionally post) around the old forums. You might have also glimpsed my name around the time V20 open development was rolling. Although I play quite rarely nowadays, I thought I'd share a vampire mini-series I've recently directed with the help of V20 Europe (the European buying group) and which was awarded a BAFTA New Talent 2014 for Cinematography by the British Academy. <br /> <br /> The series is called Judas Goat, and it follows a vampire's servant caught up in a conflict between the undead.<br /> <br /> You can find a teaser trailer here: <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/88524818\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/467015173-ae9a3587ce5371f289f92791073b0d05268872e7711126618c8c8ddaf47f15da-d\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/88524818\" target=\"_blank\"> Judas Goat - Teaser [Season 1] </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/88524818\" target=\"_blank\"> http://vimeo.com/88524818 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> To switch on subtitles, click CC (English, Spanish, German, French, Polish, Galician, Russian, Turkish, Brazilian Portugese, Italian). A Judas Goat is trained&hellip; </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> And a proper trailer (featuring music by Diary of Dreams) here: <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/95955149\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/477200227-9e467d0c8259d797b53fcab5fb43c4079e5ccf4e498f302a051303afe8881a32-d\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/95955149\" target=\"_blank\"> Judas Goat - Trailer </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/95955149\" target=\"_blank\"> http://vimeo.com/95955149 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Unfortunately subtitles are unavailable at this time. Sorry for any inconvenience. A Judas Goat is trained to associate with sheep or cattle, leading them to&hellip; </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The first episode will be live on Halloween. If the above looks interesting to you, the premiere announcement will be published on our Facebook:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/thejudasgoat\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://scontent-atl3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-1/326460728_499683148946466_8044780613371741335_n.jpg?_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=d36de4&amp;_nc_ohc=9cr5_Q0s1z8AX87d1hc&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.xx&amp;oh=00_AfBc9zEa9I3EtwWwXMTqYfKWDKe8T5nzWBhGYB2HKWg-6w&amp;oe=6446FBDB\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/thejudasgoat\" target=\"_blank\"> Judas Goat </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/thejudasgoat\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.facebook.com/thejudasgoat </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Judas Goat. 1,870 likes. A world of monsters through the eyes of their servants. -- Murder. It's just a kiss away. Watch the trailer: vimeo.com/95955149 </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Which is probably the best place to look at until the website's up and running.<br /> <br /> Cheers!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Judas Goat - a vampire mini series (BAFTA New Talent 2014 for Cine